  "targets": [
    {
      "name": "Research.Horner.forward_error",
      "statement": "For every model : Research.FloatingPoint.Model, every coefficients : List(R), and every x in R, |Q(model,coefficients,x) - P(coefficients,x)| <= E(coefficients,x,model.u). A model consists of u in R, a proof of 0 <= u, and r : R -> R such that for every z in R there exists delta in R with |delta| <= u and r(z) = z(1 + delta); model.u = u and model.round = r. P, Q, and E are the exact recursions given below. This bounds the absolute difference between the constructed rounded computation Q and the exact polynomial evaluation P, with no further hypotheses."
